sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / Dashboard
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Webhook as odh-model-controller<br/>Webhook (9443/TCP)
    participant Controller as odh-model-controller<br/>Reconciler
    participant MSAPI as model-serving-api<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS
    participant OSTLS as OpenShift APIServer<br/>TLS Profile
    participant PW as ProfileWatcher

    rect rgb(232, 245, 233)
    Note over User,Controller: Flow 1: InferenceService Deployment
    User->>K8sAPI: POST InferenceService CR<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+ / User credentials
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: Admission review<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+ / K8s admission
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Mutated + Validated response
    K8sAPI-->>User: InferenceService created

    Note over Controller: Watch event received
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create Route<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+ / SA token
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create Service<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+ / SA token
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create NetworkPolicy<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+ / SA token
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create RBAC resources<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+ / SA token
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create ServiceMonitor<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+ / SA token
    end

    rect rgb(227, 242, 253)
    Note over User,MSAPI: Flow 2: LLM Gateway Discovery
    User->>MSAPI: GET /api/v1/gateways<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+ / Bearer token
    MSAPI->>K8sAPI: SelfSubjectAccessReview<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+ / SA token
    K8sAPI-->>MSAPI: Access decision
    MSAPI->>K8sAPI: List Gateways<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+ / SA token
    K8sAPI-->>MSAPI: Gateway list
    MSAPI-->>User: Filtered gateways JSON
    end

    rect rgb(255, 243, 224)
    Note over OSTLS,PW: Flow 3: TLS Profile Change
    Note over OSTLS: Admin updates TLS profile
    OSTLS->>PW: Watch event: APIServer changed
    PW->>Controller: Cancel manager context
    Note over Controller: Graceful shutdown
    Note over Controller: Restart with new TLS config
    end
